{"hw":"ἄτεχνος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἄτεχνος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἄτεχν-ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without art, unskilful,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Plt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">274c</span> </span>; esp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">ignorant of the rules</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">principles of art,</b> opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἔντεχνος</span> or <span class=\"gk\">τεχνίτης,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">unskilled, unprofessional,</b> of persons, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">219a</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.134</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.262</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">having no trade</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">profession,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">PFlor.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.14</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(iv A.D.)</span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">unsystematic,</b> <span class=\"gk\">διδασκαλία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Anon.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">in SE</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">67.31</span> </span>; of pursuits, <span class=\"gk\">ἄ. τριβή</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phdr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">260e</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">262c</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">938a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πίστεις ἄ.</span> proofs <b class=\"lex-tr\">not invented by the orator,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1355b35</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1375a22</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀποδείξεις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ph.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.355</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">αἰσχρὸν καὶ ἄ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">not workmanlike,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fract.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">30</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πῦρ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">uncreative,</b> opp. <span class=\"gk\">τεχνικόν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Zeno Stoic.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.34</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φαντασία</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.24</span> </span>.</div></div>"}